{"5035550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Snack Station Co-op Simulator", "steam_appid": 5035550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5136990], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ALIENS ARE HUNGRY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035550/extras/ec4c94ed509ee8a69e9fd07253e917a0.poster.avif?t=1787517770\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035550/extras/ec4c94ed509ee8a69e9fd07253e917a0.webm?t=1787517770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035550/extras/ec4c94ed509ee8a69e9fd07253e917a0.mp4?t=1787517770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open a cozy little space diner with your friends way out on the edge of the galaxy. Cook up food, serve your alien customers, and make sure nobody leaves hungry!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE WHOLE PRODUCTION LINE</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035550/extras/b33d017351800c93b5f38d8b7da1c734.poster.avif?t=1787517770\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035550/extras/b33d017351800c93b5f38d8b7da1c734.webm?t=1787517770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035550/extras/b33d017351800c93b5f38d8b7da1c734.mp4?t=1787517770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to all sorts of planets in search of ingredients for your dishes. Catch cosmic creatures, gather bizarre plants, grow your own crops on the farm, and toss it all into the sci-fi blender to stock the shelves for your customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NUGGETS OR MERCY?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035550/extras/be08ded90a6d685a6d88ae79b10907fd.poster.avif?t=1787517770\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035550/extras/be08ded90a6d685a6d88ae79b10907fd.webm?t=1787517770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035550/extras/be08ded90a6d685a6d88ae79b10907fd.mp4?t=1787517770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That adorable little dragon could become the key ingredient in a pricey dish. Or a beloved pet for your customers to fawn over. You decide what to feed them: meat from rare creatures or fruit from cosmic plants. And hey, nothing's stopping you from doing both.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DECK OUT YOUR DINER</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035550/extras/383e8926d594d737c49dbfeffb21ccf9.poster.avif?t=1787517770\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035550/extras/383e8926d594d737c49dbfeffb21ccf9.webm?t=1787517770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035550/extras/383e8926d594d737c49dbfeffb21ccf9.mp4?t=1787517770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Line up the shelves, fill them with snacks, decorate the dining area, and watch your empty station slowly grow into the most stylish cafe in the galaxy.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ALIENS ARE HUNGRY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035550/extras/ec4c94ed509ee8a69e9fd07253e917a0.poster.avif?t=1787517770\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035550/extras/ec4c94ed509ee8a69e9fd07253e917a0.webm?t=1787517770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035550/extras/ec4c94ed509ee8a69e9fd07253e917a0.mp4?t=1787517770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open a cozy little space diner with your friends way out on the edge of the galaxy. Cook up food, serve your alien customers, and make sure nobody leaves hungry!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE WHOLE PRODUCTION LINE</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035550/extras/b33d017351800c93b5f38d8b7da1c734.poster.avif?t=1787517770\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035550/extras/b33d017351800c93b5f38d8b7da1c734.webm?t=1787517770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035550/extras/b33d017351800c93b5f38d8b7da1c734.mp4?t=1787517770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to all sorts of planets in search of ingredients for your dishes. Catch cosmic creatures, gather bizarre plants, grow your own crops on the farm, and toss it all into the sci-fi blender to stock the shelves for your customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NUGGETS OR MERCY?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035550/extras/be08ded90a6d685a6d88ae79b10907fd.poster.avif?t=1787517770\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035550/extras/be08ded90a6d685a6d88ae79b10907fd.webm?t=1787517770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035550/extras/be08ded90a6d685a6d88ae79b10907fd.mp4?t=1787517770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That adorable little dragon could become the key ingredient in a pricey dish. Or a beloved pet for your customers to fawn over. You decide what to feed them: meat from rare creatures or fruit from cosmic plants. And hey, nothing's stopping you from doing both.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DECK OUT YOUR DINER</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035550/extras/383e8926d594d737c49dbfeffb21ccf9.poster.avif?t=1787517770\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035550/extras/383e8926d594d737c49dbfeffb21ccf9.webm?t=1787517770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035550/extras/383e8926d594d737c49dbfeffb21ccf9.mp4?t=1787517770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Line up the shelves, fill them with snacks, decorate the dining area, and watch your empty station slowly grow into the most stylish cafe in the galaxy.</p>", "short_description": "A co-op snack bar sim on the edge of the galaxy. Land on weir